concepts=[
 ('einstein','Unsolved problem / tension','Oversized chalk hand + Einstein, clocks and orbital marks','Scale contrast makes cognitive pressure tangible; the hand reaches into the viewer’s space.','Preserve live hand/figure/clock changes; never replace with a portrait slide.'),
 ('equations','Reasoning breaks down','Burning dimensional E=mc² characters','Abstract equations become vulnerable material.','The formula is a visual symbol, not a proof of the gravity anecdote.'),
 ('clock','Time boundary and action change','Alarm clock and chalk-setting hand','2 AM turns an abstract pause into a specific physical decision.','Time shot switch to chalk/violin wording; retain full fingers and clock.'),
 ('violin','Change of cognitive mode','Standing violinist Einstein + expanding circular stage','Music shifts the mental frame; concentric stage is attention, not a new claim of scientific causation.','Keep bow/strings/shadow, not just camera zoom.'),
 ('watch','Not avoidance','Hand-held pocket watch with miniature violins','Objects compress time and practice into one image.','Use the short actual watch interval; avoid letting the next chaise leak into this beat.'),
 ('flow','Immersion versus shortcuts','Reclining violinist on a chaise, hovering cursor arrows','Digital pointers intrude on a human practice state.','Type FLOW STATE then AI SHORTCUTS follows argument; not constant subtitle clutter.'),
 ('car','Convenience / speed','Violet striped car in changing perspective','Fast transport introduces a familiar tool-benefit premise.','The car must change orientation/position in source footage, not be a still card.'),
 ('runner','Chosen effort','Runner, orbit and changing stride','People still train despite owning machines.','Protect every shoe/leg frame while cleaning old labels; motion serves contrast with car.'),
 ('engine','Outsourced work','Motorcycle with engine-headed passenger','Effort transferred to a machine becomes visible.','Do not equate body shape with worth or treat the metaphor as medical evidence.'),
 ('brain','Mental practice analogy','Bandaged brain supported by crutches','The argument makes disuse visible through a fragile support structure.','Retain pale bandage and thin crutches; disability imagery is metaphor, not diagnosis.'),
 ('shortcut','Effort replaced','Laptop suspended from bulb balloons + deflated bulb','Ideas appear inflated while the difficult climb is absent.','Retain strings, screen and pale bulb highlights; the exact phrase is rhetorical.'),
 ('talent','Divergent measures','Rising bulbs versus brain tied to a stone','Opposing vertical vectors show efficiency up / talent down.','Mask only the active tag corner: the stone occupies the other corner.'),
 ('sandbags','Paid resistance','Runner carrying a heavy bag in an empty stadium argument','Voluntary difficulty converts an apparently irrational action into training.','Protect dark-purple bag from being mistaken for heading ink; articulate weight.'),
 ('art','Unresolved consequence','Two rows of pen nibs','The tool-of-art becomes the closing object and open question.','End in clean editorial space, not the source Instagram card.')]
